OL,3,GNEWSARefuse workers' strike action over
OL,4,Apay halted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for further strike action by
OL,7,Fwaste collectors and street cleaners
OL,8,Fhas been called off "following
OL,9,Flast-minute negotiations", a union
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FOne third of Great Yarmouth Services
OL,13,F(GYS) workers, which also included
OL,14,Flandscapers and grave diggers, withdrew
OL,15,Ftheir labour earlier this month after
OL,16,Ftheir demand for a 20% pay increase was
OL,17,Frejected and they were offered a 3.3%
OL,18,Frise.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37702
